rump’s decision to abandon the climate process has been.</description><enclosure length="0" type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.ffx.io/images/$zoom_0.24809871049794652%2C$multiply_0.7554%2C$ratio_1.777778%2C$width_1059%2C$x_0%2C$y_0/t_crop_custom/q_86%2Cf_auto/e0e0c7bbb9d07a27441ab5ad4df2f4bf75ef6953"></enclosure><guid isPermaLink="false">9fc48e20-15d4-465a-919e-18fa70f786e4</guid><link>https://www.smh.com.au/environment/climate-change/bowen-defends-his-role-in-disastrous-climate-change-talks-blames-europe-and-saudi-arabia-for-implosion-20261124-p61grk.html?ref=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_source=rss_environment</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:03:37 +1100</pubDate><title>Bowen defends his role in disastrous climate talks, blames Europe and Saudi Arabia for implosion</title></item><item><category>Environment / Climate change</category><dc:creator>The Herald&#39;s View</dc:creator><description>The failed COP31 climate change summit ignores the bleeding obvious.</description><enclosure length="0" type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.ffx.io/images/$zoom_0.3049%2C$multiply_0.7554%2C$ratio_1.777778%2C$width_1059%2C$x_0%2C$y_102/t_crop_custom/q_86%2Cf_auto/5b01374c7ce08af62b76f12af41743f944ff53cb"></enclosure><guid isPermaLink="false">cc5f83b9-6b97-4c47-a9b6-730d4c4d77ee</guid><link>https://www.smh.com.au/environment/climate-change/some-action-on-climate-just-don-t-mention-fossil-fuels-20261123-p61ger.html?ref=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_source=rss_environment</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:54:02 +1100</pubDate><title>Some action on climate, just don’t mention fossil fuels</title></item><item><category>Environment / Climate change</category><dc:creator>Brooke Boney</dc:creator><description>I wonder how many people who attended COP31 have spent the last year genuinely afraid for their lives, or the lives of their kin, because of climate change.</description><enclosure length="0" type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.ffx.io/images/$zoom_0.5171%2C$multiply_0.7554%2C$ratio_1.777778%2C$width_1059%2C$x_0%2C$y_96/t_crop_custom/q_86%2Cf_auto/d2a0250d142efd759f0482bbd0ce8c68116f1e6d609b858b101a654062fa12ef"></enclosure><guid isPermaLink="false">f12f2146-c785-4b05-9191-be4ce6d21978</guid><link>https://www.smh.com.au/environment/climate-change/i-just-flew-back-from-turkey-with-tears-in-my-eyes-20261123-p61gib.html?ref=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_source=rss_environment</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:48:26 +1100</pubDate><title>I just flew back from Turkey with tears in my eyes</title></item><item><category>Environment / Climate change</category><dc:creator>Nick O&#39;Malley</dc:creator><description>The complicated global situation did not help the latest climate talks, but as president, Climate Change and Energy Minister Chris Bowen must now explain how it all went wrong.</description><enclosure length="0" type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.ffx.io/images/$zoom_0.5639%2C$multiply_0.7554%2C$ratio_1.777778%2C$width_1059%2C$x_31%2C$y_0/t_crop_custom/q_86%2Cf_auto/9981bdd65436299e1cf3ddd9d9def42e12cf88a0"></enclosure><guid isPermaLink="false">2ccdd216-9d0e-440c-aa6b-37ce14a4b8e3</guid><link>https://www.smh.com.au/environment/climate-change/there-is-no-getting-around-the-scope-of-this-failure-both-for-chris-bowen-and-the-world-20261123-p61gep.html?ref=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_source=rss_environment</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:26:40 +1100</pubDate><title>There is no getting around the scope of this failure – both for Chris Bowen and the world</title></item></channel></rss>